2 CONT Source: "Provanze di Nobilta' del Cavalier Stanislao Amerighi, Archive Ordine di Malta, Priorato di Pisa (Conventi soppressi n.132), filza 39.
2 CONT
2 CONT -----------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Knight of Saint Stephan of the Great Duchy of Tuscany in 1699
2 CONT
2 CONT The Family branch of Marcantonio, di Paolo, di Mario AMERIGHI with the death of the Count Paolo AMERIGHI (+1721) e of the Count Stanislao AMERIGHI (+1731) without posterity, dies out and the title and the estates in the Contrada d
2 CONC ella Torre in Siena, come into an inheritance of Orazio Maurizio of Carlo of Orazio of Mario AMERIGHI for this reason the eldest branch of the Family moved from AMERIGHI’s Palace of via di Pantaneto in Contrada della Pantera to th
2 CONC e Palace in the Contrada of the Torre {Tower;  in fact Carlo di Orazio Maurizio AMERIGHI won in 1696 as Captain the Palio of Siena still for this Contrada of the Pantera, while in 1822 Giuseppe (Raffaello) of Pier Francesco di Car
2 CONC lo, won the Palio of Siena as Captain of the Contrada of the Torre {Tower} – Source “Il Palio di Siena” of Neri and Cecchini –  MPS 1958)
