2 CONC  found any prevention canonical, me, Jean Frémont, priest of this parish of the Three-Rivers, day questioned Jean Terrien in the church of this parish, son of Jean Terrien and Marie Hélie, her father and mother, of the parish of S
2 CONC t-Jacques de Dieppe, and Judith Rigault, this same parish, widow of François LeMaistre, inhabitant of this place; and, having received their mutual assent, the married day, with the required ceremonies, in the presence of Maurice 
