2 CONT * The princely title of San Nicandro was created in 1649 for Domenico Cattaneo della Volta, scion of a noble family from Genoa. His grandson '''Don Domenico Cattaneo della Volta, 3.Principe di San Nicandro (1698-1782)''' married D
2 CONC onna Giulia di Capua, 12.Duchessa di Termoli, a descendant of Ferdinando di Capua, 4.Duca di Termoli, and Vittoria Sanseverino dei Principi di Bisignano, at her turn a great granddaughter of Gjon (Giovanni) Castriota Scanderbeg, s
2 CONC ince 1485 1.Duca di San Pietro in Galatina, and Jerina Palaiologina Brankovič, daughter of Lazar Brankovič, Despot of Raška, and Elena Palaiologina, granddaughter of Manuel II Byzantine Emperor.
2 CONT
