2 CONT * Notas Biogr <><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><
2 CONT * '''Don Juan de la Cruz and Pizarro Moncada Bellvís Ibáñez de Segovia and Herrera'''  (Madrid, 1756-Madrid, 1835), ninth Marquis of Villamayor of Ibernias, Marquis of Belgida III, IX and Perpetual Hereditary Mayor Head of the New
2 CONC  Galicia, XII perpetual lord of Upper and Lower Apaseos, and Valdecantos, Marquis of Benavites VII, XIV Marquis of Mondejar, Villamonte Count VII, XI Villardompardo Count, Count VII Sallent Tendilla Count XIII, XV count of the Hol
2 CONC y Roman Empire, Count of Gomera, Marquis de San Juan de las Piedras Albas Valhermoso of Tajuña Marquis, Marquis of Adeje, Agrópoli, Orellana la Vieja, Baron of Rafol Turís-Chela of the Bank and Abalat Pardines , the Joyosa, lord o
2 CONC f Marran of Tudichelli and Guderni, and the villages of San Juan de la Enova, Quertell-Carrap, Corvera, Rafal, Buñol, Puig, Anguix, Fermoselle, Ampudia, etc. Mayor Perpetual Ensign City of Jaen, Governor of the Alhambra, '''Knight
2 CONC  of the Golden Fleece, Knight of the Royal Spanish Order''' of Carlos III, twice Grandee of Spain First Class, Gentleman of the King's Chamber, Groom, Montero and Major SM Ballestero King Carlos IV, chief butler of Palace and Corp
2 CONC s of SM Sommelier King Ferdinand VII. 
2 CONT * He '''married''' Marie of the Incarnation Dona Ignacia Alvarez de Toledo y Gonzaga, Queen of the Royal Order of Queen Maria Luisa, '''daughter of''' Don Antonio Alvarez de Toledo and Maria Perez de Guzman el Bueno, Prince of Pat
2 CONC erno VIII, VII Montabano prince, Duke of Fernandina VII, VIII Duke Bivona, Duke Montalto X, X Marquis of Villafranca del Bierzo, X Marquis of Velez, Marquis de Molina IX, VI Marquis de Martorell, V Marquis of Villanueva de Valduez
2 CONC a, Ramiro Pena Count V, aderno Count XVI, XVII Earl of Baltabellota, sixteenth Earl of Sclafani, conte di Caltanissetta XIV, XIII conte di Collesano, conte di Centerví nineteenth Earl of Golisano, Baron of Rosanahes Casetellví, Gr
2 CONC andee of Spain, Governor and Mayor captian of the United Murcia, Warden of Realez Alcázares Perpetual Lorca, '''Knight of the Order of the Golden Fleece''', and Maria Antonia Gonzaga and Dorotea Caracciolo Sinforosa (widow of the 
2 CONC Duke of Bejar XII), in turn daughter of Don Francesco Gonzaga and Pico della Mirandola, Duke of Solferino I, Prince of the Holy Roman Empire, Prince of Castiglione, Grandee of Spain, '''Knight of the Order of the Golden Fleece''',
2 CONC  and Giulia Caracciolo di Santo Buono Clitteria and Ruffo, daughter of the princes of Santo Buono V .
