1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LJ2S-WNK
2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie Catherine
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Catherine Ménard was born on 27 September 1673, in Boucherville, Montreal, Canada, New France, her father, Jacques Menard dit Lafontaine, was 45 and her mother, Catherine Fortier, was 33. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Jacques Rivière on 1 February 1699, in Boucherville, Chambly, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 8 sons and 4 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 1 January 1727, in Montreal, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 53, and was buried in Notre-Dame, Montreal, Canada, New France.
2 CONT A une enfant ''naturelle''(père inconnu): M.-Madeleine, néée le 7 et baptisée le 9/8/1698 à Boucherville.
2 CONT --------------------
