2 CONT Pierre (Lemaitre) LEMAISTRE [Parents] 1 was born on 2 Feb 1655 in Trois Rivieres, St Maurice, Quebec. He was christened on 2 Feb 1655 in Trois Rivieres, , Quebec, Canada. He died on 13 Aug 1711 in Trois Rivieres, St Maurice, Quebe
2 CONC c. He was buried on 13 Aug 1711 in Trois Rivieres, , Quebec, Canada. He married Marie Anne CHESNAY on 8 Jan 1682 in Trois Rivieres, St Maurice, Quebec.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie Anne CHESNAY [Parents] 1 was born on 12 Oct 1664 in Quebec City, Quebec, Quebec. She was christened on 12 Oct 1664 in Notre-Dame-De-Qu, Quebec, Quebec. She died on 10 Jul 1733 in Trois-Rivieres, Quebec. She married Pierre (L
2 CONC emaitre) LEMAISTRE on 8 Jan 1682 in Trois Rivieres, St Maurice, Quebec. She had other parents.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT F i Marie Francoise LEMAISTRE
2 CONT M ii Pierre (Lemaitre) LOTTINVILLE 1 was born on 17 Oct 1684 in Trois Rivieres, St Maurice, Quebec. He was christened on 17 Oct 1684 in Trois Rivieres, S-Mrc, Quebec. He died on 18 Aug 1771.
2 CONT M iii Louis LEMAISTRE 1 was born on 6 Jan 1689 in Trois Rivieres, St Maurice, Quebec.
2 CONT F iv Marie Madeleine LEMAISTRE 1 was born on 1 Feb 1691 in Trois Rivieres, St Maurice, Quebec. She died on 26 May 1731.
2 CONT F v Marie Louise LEMAISTRE 1 was born on 19 Aug 1695 in Trois Rivieres, St Maurice, Quebec.
2 CONT F vi Marie Charlotte LEMAISTRE 1 was born on 3 Feb 1700 in Trois Rivieres, St Maurice, Quebec.
2 CONT F vii Marie Exupere LEMAISTRE 1 was born on 7 May 1702 in Trois Rivieres, St Maurice, Quebec. She died on 17 May 1731.
2 CONT F viii Marie Anne LEMAISTRE 1 was born on 17 Apr 1708 in Trois Rivieres, St Maurice, Quebec.
2 CONT F ix Marie Anne LEMAISTRE 1 was born on 13 Dec 1682 in Trois Rivieres, St Maurice, Quebec. She died on 4 Dec 1700.
2 CONT F x Jeanne LEMAITRE 1 was born in Aug 1693 in Trois Rivieres, St Maurice, Quebec.
2 CONT F xi Marquerite LEMAISTRE 1 was born on 30 May 1686 in Three Rivers, St. Maurice, Quebec. She was buried on 26 Jul 1756 in Trois Rivieres, , Quebec, Canada.
