2 CONT Married 11 Oct 1689 Madeleine Crevier (#1682) (aka Bellerive; dau of Nicolas Crevier #687 & Louise Leloutre #1680; born abt 1670; bap 1671 according to Tanguay Vol V pg 309) at Notre Dame de Montreal, Ile de Montreal, Quebec, Cana
2 CONC da; have copy of this record; sources:  (ct 06 Adhemar); Tanguay Vol I pg 375 shows family with 10 children; Tanguay Vol V pg 309 shows family with 9 children; Tanguay Vol I pg 374; Drouin pg 822; family (12 children) listed in Je
