2 CONT <p style="text-align: left;" dir="ltr"><strong><span style="font-size: medium;">Principe di Castelvetrano</span></strong></p> <p class="western" style="margin-bottom: 0cm;" align="justify"><span style="font-size: medium;">6. &mdas
