1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/L659-FPC
2 CONT Brief Life History of Marguerite'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marguerite Ménard Lafontaine was born on 7 January 1689, in Boucherville, Montreal, Canada, New France, her father, Jean Baptiste Ménard dit Lafontaine, was 28 and her mother, Louise Marguerite Philippe Etienne, was 27. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married 1st husband Lambert Cuillerier (1682–1709)
2 CONT on 28 décembre 1707 in 
2 CONT Notre-Dame, Montreal, Canada, Nouvelle-France
2 CONT They had one daughter
2 CONT Marie Angelique Cuillerier 1708–1764
2 CONT
2 CONT She married 2nd husband François St-Germain dit Lamoureux on 26 July 1712, in Sainte-Anne-de-Bellevue, Montreal, Canada, New France. They were the parents of at least 7 sons and 7 daughters. 
2 CONT Marie Joseph Lamoureux 1714–
2 CONT François Charles Lamoureux 1715–1782
2 CONT Marie Charlotte Lamoureux St-Germain 1717–1745
2 CONT Joseph St Germain 1719–1754
2 CONT Philippe Lamoureux St-Germain 1721–
2 CONT Louise St Germain 1722–1722
2 CONT Pierre Lamoureux 1723–1793
2 CONT Louis Lamoureux dit St-Germain 1724–1782
2 CONT Jean Baptiste St Germain dit Lamoureux 1726–1726
2 CONT Marguerite Therese Lamoureux 1727–
2 CONT Theresa Catherine Anne Lamoureux dit St. Germain 1727–1765
2 CONT Marie Catherine Lamoureux 1729–1729
2 CONT Therese Catherine St Germain 1729–1765
2 CONT Michel St. Germain dit Lamoureux 1730–1731
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 29 November 1774, in Lachine, Montreal, Quebec, British North America, at the age of 85, and was buried in Saints-Anges-de-Lachine, Montreal, Quebec, British North America.
