2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie Catherine
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Catherine Menard was born on 5 July 1694, in Bouchard, Les Éboulements, Charlevoix, Quebec, Canada, her father, Jean Baptiste Ménard dit Lafontaine, was 33 and her mother, Louise Marguerite Philippe Etienne GGM, was 32.
2 CONC
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Gilles Le Cour on 17 January 1712, in Montreal, Montreal, Canada, New France. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 10 daughters. She lived in Longueuil, Montreal, Canada, New France in 1694.
2 CONT
2 CONT  She died on 14 February 1758, in L'Assomption, Montreal, Canada, New France, at the age of 63, and was buried in Lachenaie, Montreal, Canada, New France.
