2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie Jeanne
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Jeanne Riviere was born on 27 April 1699, in Boucherville, Chambly, Quebec, Canada, her father, Jacques Rivière, was 20 and her mother, Marie Catherine Ménard, was 25. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Pierre Aubertin on 9 January 1723, in Sainte-Famille, Montreal, Canada, New France. They were the parents of at least 6 sons and 3 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 23 June 1778, in her hometown, at the age of 79, and was buried in Sainte-Famille, Montreal, Quebec, British North America.
2 CONT
