2 CONT Brief Life History of Jacques
2 CONT
2 CONT When Jacques Larivière was born on 28 December 1702, in Longueuil, Chambly, Quebec, Canada, his father, Jacques Rivière, was 24 and his mother, Marie Catherine Ménard, was 29. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie-Charlotte Lart on 1 March 1734, in Montreal, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 2 sons and 9 daughters. 
2 CONT Marie Amable Larivière 1735–1759
2 CONT Louise Élisabeth Marie Larivière 1737–1823
2 CONT Jacques LaRivière 1739–1821
2 CONT Marie Madeleine Larivière 1741–1776
2 CONT Marie Catherine Larivière 1743–1798
2 CONT Thérèse Larivière 1746–1808
2 CONT Charlotte Larivière 1748–1831
2 CONT François Larivière 1750–1751
2 CONT Marie Josephe Lariviere 1752–1770
2 CONT Marie Genevieve Lariviere 1755–1832
2 CONT Marie- Francoise Lariviere 1756–1757
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 6 October 1791, in Pierrefonds, Montreal, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 88, and was buried in Pierrefonds, Montreal, Quebec, Canada.
