2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie Josephe
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Josephe Lemaître Auger was born on 1 January 1710, in Saint-Maurice, Quebec, Canada, her father, Charles Lemaitre, was 43 and her mother, Marie Madeleine Crevier, was 40. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Joseph Noël Fafart on 14 February 1729, in Louiseville, Maskinongé, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 4 daughters.
2 CONT
2 CONT  She lived in Rivière-du-Loup, Canada, New France in 1710. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 28 March 1788, in Rivière-du-Loup, Quebec, British North America, at the age of 78, and was buried in Rivière-du-Loup, Quebec, British North America.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT alternative date of birth: 13 January 1710 - Trois-Rivières, Canada.
2 CONT alternative date of wedding: 19 February 1729, Louiseville, Canada.
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''Sources:'''
2 CONT **Drouin Institute (Archived birth and baptismal record - see attached record in the Media tab)
2 CONT
2 CONT Also known as Marie Joseph Auger.
2 CONT --------------------
