2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie Charlotte
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Charlotte Lamoureux dit  St-Germain was born on 7 May 1717, in Sainte-Anne-de-Bellevue, Jacques-Cartier, Quebec, Canada, her father, François Lamoureux dit  St-Germain, was 44 and her mother, Marguerite Ménard Lafontain
2 CONC e, was 28. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Pierre Hubert on 24 April 1741, in Sainte-Anne-de-Bellevue, Jacques-Cartier, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 3 daughters. 
2 CONT Marie Charlotte Hubert 1742–
2 CONT Marie Angelique Hubert 1743–1744
2 CONT Marie Marguerite Hubert 1745–1778
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 9 June 1745, in Longue-Pointe, Montreal, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 28, and was buried in Montreal, Quebec, Canada.
