1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/M182-GVB
2 CONT Brief Life History of Marguerite
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marguerite Lecour was born on 6 August 1718, in Île de Montréal, Archipel d'Hochelaga, Fleuve Saint-Laurent, Quebec, Canada, her father, Gilles Le Cour, was 33 and her mother, Marie Catherine Menard, was 24. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Pierre Jean Pelletier on 16 June 1738, in Montreal, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 8 sons and 6 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 24 May 1795, in Repentigny, L'Assomption, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 76, and was buried in Quebec, Canada.
