1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LC22-7S5
2 CONT Brief Life History of Paul'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Paul Ménard dit Bellerose was born on 7 March 1729, in Boucherville, Lajemmerais, Quebec, Canada, his father, Louis Ménard Bellerose, was 37 and his mother, Marie Madeleine Brien, was 33. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Anne Denoyon on 7 May 1764, in Sainte-Famille, Boucherville, Chambly, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 1 son and 4 daughters. 
2 CONT Marie Anne Menard dit Bellerose 1765–1824
2 CONT Marie Angelique Menard dit Bellerose 1766–1766
2 CONT Marguerite Menard dit Bellerose 1766–1834
2 CONT Baby boy Menard 1766–1766
2 CONT Antoine Menard dit Bellerose 1770–1819
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT He died about 13 May 1772, in Longueuil, Chambly, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 43, and was buried in Longueuil, Chambly, Quebec, Canada.
