2 CONT
2 CONT His first wife, Jeanne Patenaude, died at the age of 26. He married her on 11 January 1734, St-Antoine, Longueuil and they had one son (Antoine Lanctot). His third wife, Catherine Babeau, he married on 2 August 1762 in La Prairie,
2 CONC  Quebec, Canada (he was 52 years old and she was 60 years old). 
