1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LZPZ-Z2B
2 CONT Brief Life History of Francois'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Francois Aubertin was born on 26 March 1732, in Boucherville, Chambly, Quebec, Canada, his father, Pierre Aubertin, was 31 and his mother, Marie Jeanne Riviere, was 32. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 1st wife Genevieve Grise (1735-1756) 
2 CONT on 28 January 1754, in Chambly, Chambly, Lower Canada, British North America. They were the parents of at least 1 son and 1 daughter. 
2 CONT Genevieve Aubertin Bertin 1754–1831
2 CONT Toussaint Aubertin 1754–1841
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 2nd wife Madeleine Laporte (1734–1785)
2 CONT on 4 November 1760 in Boucherville, Chambly, Quebec, Canada
2 CONT They had at least 6 sons and 3 daughters
2 CONT Pierre Aubertin 1761–1821
2 CONT Francois Aubertin (1) 1763–1763
2 CONT Francois Aubertin (2) 1764–
2 CONT Madeleine Aubertin (1) 1764–1764
2 CONT Marie Madeleine Aubertin (2) 1765–1833
2 CONT Jean Baptiste Aubertin 1768–
2 CONT Francois Aubertin (3) 1769–1769
2 CONT Mariie Francoise Aubertin 1770–
2 CONT Francois Aubertin (4) 1772–
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 3rd wife Marie Josephte Chicot Dit Sicotte (1731–1773)
2 CONT on 9 August 1773 in Boucherville, Chambly, Quebec, Canada.
2 CONT No children.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 4th wife Marie Josephe Bridelle (1772–1804)
2 CONT on 14 November 1791 in Boucherville, Chambly, Quebec, Canada
2 CONT They had at least 1 son and 2 daughters
2 CONT Jean Baptiste Aubertin (1795–1795)
2 CONT Marie Julie Aubertin (1796– )
2 CONT Emilie Aubertin c.1797-
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 5th wife Marie Madeleine Vermet 1759–1837
2 CONT on 28 Septembre 1807 in Sainte-Famille, Boucherville, Chambly, Québec, Canada
2 CONT No children
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 10 October 1814, in his hometown, at the age of 82, and was buried in Boucherville, Chambly, Quebec, Canada.
