1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LCX6-B3V
2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie Catherine'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Catherine Larivière was born in November 1743, in Sainte-Geneviève, Jacques-Cartier, Quebec, Canada, her father, Jacques Larivière, was 40 and her mother, Marie-Charlotte Lart Alarie-Allard, was 27. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Joseph Parnier dit Vadeboncoeur I on 4 November 1760, in Sainte Genevieve, D'Autray, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 9 sons and 5 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She lived in Sainte Genevieve, D'Autray, Quebec, Canada in 1760 and Detroit, Wayne, Michigan, United States in 1771. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 7 August 1798, in Upper Canada, British North America, at the age of 54, and was buried in Detroit, Northwest Territory, United States.
