1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/L62Z-GDD
2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie Madeleine'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Madeleine Larivière was born on 21 August 1741, in Sainte-Geneviève, Montreal, Quebec, Canada, her father, Jacques Larivière, was 38 and her mother, Marie-Charlotte Lart Alarie-Allard, was 25. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Jean Baptiste Benèche dit Lavictoire on 4 May 1761, in Pierrefonds, Montreal, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 7 sons. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 17 April 1776, in her hometown, at the age of 34, and was buried in Sainte-Geneviève, Jacques-Cartier, Quebec, Canada.
