1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/KNBM-C6W
2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie Angelique'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Angelique Crevier was born on 21 January 1733, in Saint-François, Trois-Rivières, Canada, New France, her father, Joseph Crevier dit  St-François, was 34 and her mother, Marie Charlotte Lemaitre, was 32. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married 1st husband Jacques Dupéron Bâby (1731-1789) on 5 February 1750, in Saint-François-du-Lac, Odanak, Nicolet-Yamaska, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 4 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married 2nd husband Joseph-Antoine Pinard Lauzière (1718–1793)
2 CONT on 16 May 1758 in Saint-Francois-du-Lac, Yamaska, Quebec, Canada
2 CONT They had at least 14 children
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 12 February 1776, in Saint-François-du-Lac, Odanak, Nicolet-Yamaska, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 43.
