1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LCJT-T7X
2 CONT Brief Life History of Jean Baptiste'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Jean Baptiste Fafard was born on 29 March 1737, in Sorel-Tracy, Pierre-De Saurel, Quebec, Canada, his father, Joseph Noël Fafart, was 39 and his mother, Marie Josephe Lemaître Auger, was 27. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Charlotte Aubuchon Dulac on 21 January 1765, in Île Dupas, D'Autray, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 2 sons and 1 daughter. 
2 CONT
2 CONT After the death of Charlotte, he married Marie Genevieve Pelletier Chateauneuf Antaya (
2 CONT 1746–1775) on 11 avril 1774 in Saint-Cuthbert, Berthier, Quebec, Canada
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 21 February 1791, in Saint-Cuthbert, D'Autray, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 53, and was buried in Saint-Cuthbert, Berthier, Quebec, Canada.
2 CONT
2 CONT
