1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/GZNJ-1XH
2 CONT Brief Life History of Michel-Gabriel
2 CONT
2 CONT When Michel-Gabriel Lefebvre Descoteaux was born on 31 May 1736, in Baie-du-Febvre, Nicolet-Yamaska, Quebec, Canada, his father, Antoine Lefebvre Dit Descoteaux, was 30 and his mother, Marie Anne Therrien, was 25. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Catherine Caillé  CAYER on 24 August 1767, in Saint-François-du-Lac, Odanak 12, Yamaska, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 8 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 12 April 1802, in Saint-François-du-Lac, Odanak 12, Yamaska, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 65, and was buried in Saint-François-du-Lac, Odanak, Nicolet-Yamaska, Quebec, Canada.
