1 CONT
1 CONT MENARD, Maurice - interpreter of the Ottawa languages and of other nations (Spouse: M-Madeleine Couc m. before 1684 in Michillimakinac) 
1 CONT
1 CONT - 14 April 1705 Notary: M. Lepailleur de LaFerté (Mt) 
1 CONT Bond from Maurice Mesnard, interepreter of the Ottawa languages and of other nations, of Villemarie, Capitalle Street, to Antoine Pascaud, bourgeois merchant, of Villemarie, the Lord Pierre of Lestaigne, assistant, present and acc
1 CONC epted
1 CONT
1 CONT - 15 Oct 1705 Notary: M. Lepailleur de LaFerté (Mt) 
