1 CONT Bond from Maurice Mesnard, interpreter of Ottawa language and M-Madeleine Couq, his spouse, of Boucherville, and Antoine Mesnard, their son, to François-Marie Bouat, counselor for the King and his special lieutenant of the Roayal 
